{'symbol': 'AMCR', 'date': '2019-11-06 22:30:00', 'title': 'AMCOR PLC DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 17, 2019', 'text': "THE AMCOR BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF 11.5 US CENTS PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAID IN US DOLLARS TO HOLDERS OF AMCOR'S ORDINARY SHARES TRADING ON THE NYSE. HOLDERS OF CDIS TRADING ON THE ASX WILL RECEIVE AN UNFRANKED DIVIDEND OF 16.7 AUSTRALIAN CENTS WHICH REFLECTS THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF 11.5 US CENTS PER SHARE CONVERTED AT AN AVERAGE AUD:USD EXCHANGE RATE OF 0.687 OVER THE FIVE TRADING DAYS ENDED 1 NOVEMBER 2019. THE EX-DIVIDEND DATE WILL BE 27 NOVEMBER 2019, THE RECORD DATE WILL BE 28 NOVEMBER 2019 AND THE PAYMENT DATE WILL BE 17 DECEMBER 2019."}